imud-mavlink (1.6.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Config keys unchanged (per-transport enables already existed); the
    stock config now ships enabled = true like the other bridges, with
    every transport off.
  * Fix: enabled = false no longer crash-loops under systemd (Type=notify)
    — the bridge signals readiness before exiting cleanly.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud-mavlink (1.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New tcp_enabled/tcp_bind_addr/tcp_port keys: a TCP listener (default
    port 5760, the de-facto MAVLink TCP port) that ground stations connect
    to directly (QGroundControl / Mission Planner tcp://HOST:5760), running
    alongside the UDP and serial transports.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sun, 19 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

